ID: B3-Ch04a-Cooperate2
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_magical_sense < 3)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_magical_sense >= 3)
#if(v_magical_sense < 3) {
 

For the first few spells, everything goes smoothly. Both Illuna and Breynan are executing their movements perfectly, and the trap is reacting exactly how it should. As they reach the final seal, an unseen dissonance builds between their channels.

Before either caster can correct the flow, the core of the ward destabilizes.

The threshold detonates in a blinding white flash that swallows the corridor whole.

}
#if(v_magical_sense >= 3) {
 

For the first few spells, everything goes smoothly. Both Illuna and Breynan are executing their movements perfectly, and the trap is reacting exactly how it should. As they approach the deeper core, an underlying vibration ripples through the ward's field.

My magical sense picks up the micro-tremor along the boundary seam—a microscopic desynchronization between their flow rates. If they proceed to the final seal at this tempo, the mismatch will trigger the fail-safe.

"Halt the inversion!" I shout. "Break the channel!"

Illuna and Breynan instantly drop their hands, grounding their mana as the ward's field settles back into static tension.

"What did you see?" Illuna asks, her brow knit. "The exterior anchors were collapsing cleanly."

 "A micro-tremor in the boundary seam," I say. "Your flow rates are drifting apart. You're executing the somatic too fast for two unbonded casters. Cut your tempo in half so your channels have time to align."

"Cut the tempo?" Breynan frowns. "A spell requires specific velocity to manifest!"

"This is an inversion, not an offensive cast," I say. "The matrix doesn't care about velocity, only directional alignment. Slow down and let the mana stabilize."

"Understood," Illuna says. "We reset."

They begin the sequence again at half speed. With my magical sense tracking the boundary seam, the flow remains glass-smooth. The final thread uncoils without a trace of vibration, and the glowing ward fades from the stone doorway.

}
choice("Restart game", Ch1-Intro1, v_current_scene = Ch1-Intro1, special:restart) if (v_magical_sense < 3)
